flowchart TD
  a[Email text after masking<br/>and normalization] --> b[mSBERT encode to e, 384-d,<br/>L2-normalized]
  c[Category descriptions] --> d[mSBERT encode each<br/>category description]
  d --> e{Learned centroid<br/>available?}
  e -- yes --> f[Use the Rocchio centroid c_k]
  e -- no --> g[Use the description embedding]
  f --> h["score_k = cos(e, c_k)<br/>+ keyword weight 0.3<br/>+ sender-role weight 0.02"]
  g --> h
  b --> h
  h --> i[Rank all categories]
  i --> j{"Top score at least τ = 0.35?"}
  j -- yes --> k([Assign the top category])
  j -- no --> l([Uncategorized:<br/>suggest a library label])
